# One .env file serves every demo, exercise and the project in this course.
# 1. Copy .env.template in the course root folder (cd14705-azure-agentic-c2-classroom)
#    to a new file named .env in that same folder.
# 2. In .env, fill in both values below and save the file.
#
# AZURE_OPENAI_KEY: a key of your Microsoft Foundry resource.
# URL: that resource's Azure OpenAI endpoint, for example https://<resource-name>.openai.azure.com/
#      (not the project endpoint that ends in /api/projects/...). The code keeps only the part
#      before /openai/, so the /openai/v1/ URL or a deployment's Target URI also works.
AZURE_OPENAI_KEY=""
URL=""
